flowchart LR
    User[用户] --> Mic[麦克风/USB声卡]
    User --> CameraView[真实场景/手持物体]
    CameraView --> Camera[树莓派摄像头]

    subgraph Frontend[Chromium Kiosk 前端]
        UI[静态眼睛/表情界面]
        VAD[VAD与麦克风控制]
        WSClient[WebSocket客户端]
    end

    subgraph Backend[FastAPI 后端服务]
        WSHandler[WebSocketHandler]
        Wake[唤醒词门控]
        Conv[Conversation Handler]
        Visual[视觉意图判断]
        CamSvc[BackendCameraService]
        TTS[TTS Manager]
        ServoSvc[Face/Ear Motion Service]
    end

    subgraph Model[模型与语音能力]
        ASR[ASR语音识别]
        VLM[Qwen-VL视觉语言模型]
        TTSEngine[TTS语音合成]
    end

    subgraph Hardware[硬件执行与输出]
        Speaker[扬声器/pw-play]
        PCA[PCA9685舵机驱动]
        Servo[底盘/耳朵舵机]
    end

    Mic --> VAD --> WSClient --> WSHandler
    WSHandler --> ASR --> Wake --> Conv
    Conv --> Visual
    Visual --> CamSvc
    Camera --> CamSvc
    CamSvc --> Conv
    Conv --> VLM --> TTS --> TTSEngine
    TTSEngine --> TTS
    TTS --> WSHandler --> WSClient --> UI
    TTS --> Speaker
    Conv --> ServoSvc --> PCA --> Servo
